    "fullDescriptionEn": "💗 NATURAL ROSE QUARTZ BRACELET 8MM (Natural Rose Quartz Bracelet 8mm)\n\n\n🪷 PRODUCT INFORMATION\n\n• Product Name: Natural Rose Quartz Bracelet 8mm\n\n• English Name: Natural Rose Quartz Bracelet 8mm\n\n• Origin: Madagascar, South Africa mines – Processed in Vietnam\n\n• Processing & Finishing: Ann Gem & Fengshui cooperative workshop in Vietnam\n\n• Distribution Brand: Ann Gem & Fengshui – Recharge Your Energy, Restore Your Balance\n\n• Size: 8mm (standard female wrist, suitable for wrist 14–17cm)\n\n• Material: 100% Natural Rose Quartz, light pink to deep pink color, natural misty transparency, undyed, unheat-treated.\n\n\n________________________________________\n💰 PRICING\n\n| Category | Price (VND) | Product Code | Note |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Retail List Price | 1,399,000 (price without separate certification) | AGFS 028 | Includes 10% VAT, excludes shipping |\n| Market Price | 999,000 (price without separate certification) | AGFS 028 | Includes VAT, excludes shipping |\n\n\n________________________________________\n🌈 FENG SHUI MEANING\n🔹 Characteristics\nRose Quartz is a stone carrying the energy of Love, Emotion, and Healing. With a high, gentle vibration frequency, it expands the Heart Chakra, soothes emotional traumas, and attracts loving energy into all relationships.\n🔹 Feng Shui Analysis\nIn the Five Elements, Rose Quartz belongs to the Fire and partly Earth elements, carrying Yang properties, symbolizing warmth, affection, and life.\n\nWhen worn near the heart area, the stone helps balance emotional energy, opens compassion, increases communication ability, and empathy.\n🔹 Uses\n\n• Activates love energy, helps relationships become harmonious.\n\n• Soothes emotions, reduces stress, increases a sense of inner peace.\n\n• Enhances cardiovascular health, aids deep sleep.\n\n• Helps the wearer exude friendly and confident energy.\n🔹 Symbolic Meaning\nRose Quartz is compared to the “stone of the heart” – a symbol of pure love, empathy, and compassion. It also represents soft femininity, beauty, and inner strength.\n🔹 Compatible Elements\nMost compatible with Fire, Earth, and Metal elements.\n\nPeople with Water or Wood elements should pair it with white or amethyst quartz bracelet to neutralize the energy.\n\n\n________________________________________\n💎 EXPERT FENG SHUI INTERPRETATION\n1. Energy Science\nRose Quartz emits a gentle oscillating frequency, which balances the emotional magnetic field, helping the wearer increase Yang energy and reduce stress energy.\n\nThis is a stone belonging to the “healing crystal” group – helping to heal soul and emotional wounds.\n2. Feng Shui House Protection (Trấn Trạch)\nPlacing the Rose Quartz bracelet in the Southwest corner (Love/Relationship sector) or the bedroom helps boost loving energy, dissolve loneliness, and reinforce marital affection.\n3. Application in Living Space\nWhen not worn, the bracelet can be placed on a silk tray, with a few dried rose petals or gentle candlelight, to enhance romantic energy and calm the space.\n\n\n________________________________________\n🪶 FENG SHUI PRODUCT PROFILE\n1. Product Description\nThe bracelet consists of 18–20 round 8mm beads, misty translucent pink color, strung with high-quality elastic cord, softly hugging the wrist.\n2. Composition & Structure\n100% Natural Rose Quartz, untreated, Mohs hardness 7.\n\nSmooth surface, gentle light reflection, natural bright pink tone.\n3. Manufacturing Process\nRough stone selected in Madagascar, then polished, energy cleansed, and hand-strung at Ann Gem & Fengshui workshop in Vietnam.\n4. Key Functions\n\n• Emotional healing, increases love.\n\n• Supports sleep and mental relaxation.\n\n• Attracts good relationships (Nhân Duyên) and romantic luck.\n\n5. Unique Selling Points (USP)\n\n• 100% natural pink color, undyed.\n\n• Energy cleansed and certified in Vietnam.\n\n• Specialized packaging with energy card & Feng Shui usage guide.\n\n6. Recommended Users\nSuitable for women, office workers, those suffering from insomnia, people needing emotional energy recovery, or as a gift for birthdays – anniversaries.\n7. Precautions\nAvoid prolonged contact with seawater, chemicals, or high temperatures. When not in use, place in a dry, airy place, away from direct sunlight.\n8. Why choose this product\nRose Quartz bracelet is a symbol of love and serenity, suitable as a Feng Shui gift carrying a message of healing, combining real energy and modern aesthetic value.\n\n\n________________________________________\n💬 FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ)\nQ: Can it be worn with other bracelets?\nA: Yes, it pairs especially well with White Quartz or Amethyst Quartz to boost energy balancing effectiveness.\nQ: How should the energy be cleansed?\nA: Every 30–45 days, use moonlight, incense smoke, or place the bracelet on a White Quartz base to recharge energy.\nQ: Should it be worn while sleeping?\nA: It can be, especially for those with insomnia or anxiety; Rose Quartz energy helps lighten the mind, making it easier to fall asleep.\n\n\n________________________________________\n🧭 AUTHENTICITY CHECK GUIDE\n\n| Characteristic | Description |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Luster | Real stone has a natural matte sheen, not overly plastic-like shine. |\n| Touch Sensation | Real stone is always cool to the touch, even in a warm environment. |\n| Natural Veins | Has different fibers, layers, and light/dark areas, not perfectly uniform. |\n| Weight | Feels heavy in hand, heavier than plastic or glass. |\n| Sound | When tapping two beads gently, real stone produces a clear and resonant sound. |"
