    "fullDescriptionEn": "NATURAL BLACK QUARTZ BRACELET 8MM (Morion Quartz)\n\n\n🪷 PRODUCT INFORMATION\n\n• Product Name: Natural Black Quartz Bracelet 8mm\n\n• English Name: Natural Black Quartz Bracelet 8mm (Morion Quartz)\n\n• Origin: Brazil Mines – Processed in Vietnam\n\n• Processing & Finishing: Ann Gem & Fengshui cooperative workshop in Vietnam\n\n• Distribution Brand: Ann Gem & Fengshui – Recharge Your Energy, Restore Your Balance\n\n• Size: 8mm (standard female wrist or small male wrist)\n\n• Material: 100% Natural Black Quartz (Morion Quartz), characteristic deep mirror polish and translucency\n\n\n________________________________________\n💰 PRICING\n\n| Category | Price (VND) | Product Code | Note |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Retail List Price | 1,499,000 (price without separate certification) | AGFS027 | Includes 10% VAT, excludes shipping |\n| Market Price | 1,099,000 (price without separate certification) | AGFS027 | Includes VAT, excludes shipping |\n\n\n________________________________________\n🌈 FENG SHUI MEANING\n🔹 Characteristics:\nBlack Quartz (Morion Quartz) belongs to the strong energy quartz group, with a low but stable vibration frequency, absorbing negative energy, counteracting magnetic interference, and calming the mind.\n🔹 Feng Shui Analysis:\nIn the Five Elements, Black Quartz belongs to the Water element, carrying deep – still – absorbent energy. The stone has the ability to draw negative energy from the environment, helping the wearer maintain a state of balance.\n🔹 Uses:\n\n• Calms the spirit, aids deep sleep, reduces anxiety.\n\n• Supports meditation, enhances intuition.\n\n• Protects from negative energy, especially when traveling or working in crowded places.\n\n• Supports people in professions facing much pressure or criticism/gossip.\n🔹 Symbolic Meaning:\nSymbol of inner strength – protection – stillness. In East Asian culture, Black Quartz is viewed as an “energy shield,” symbolizing stability, perseverance, and the ability to overcome challenges.\n🔹 Compatible Elements:\nWater, Wood, Metal elements are particularly compatible.\n\nPeople with Fire or Earth elements should pair it with white or yellow quartz bracelet to neutralize the energy.\n\n\n________________________________________\n💎 EXPERT FENG SHUI INTERPRETATION\n1. Energy Science:\nBlack Quartz emits a low, stable frequency, creating an energy field that helps balance the lower chakras (1–3). This group of stones has the effect of “regulating deep energy,” keeping the wearer from mental fluctuations or negative emotions.\n2. Feng Shui House Protection (Trấn Trạch):\nPlacing the bracelet or a piece of black quartz near the main door, work desk, or bedroom helps neutralize evil chi (Tà Khí), reduce Yin energy (Âm Năng Lượng), especially in high-traffic work environments or places with mixed energy fields.\n3. Application in Living Space:\nWhen not worn, the bracelet can be placed on a wooden base or silk mat in the meditation room, workspace, or bedside — helping to create a region of peaceful energy and purify the energy field.\n\n\n________________________________________\n🪶 FENG SHUI PRODUCT PROFILE\n1. Product Description\nThe bracelet consists of 18 round 8mm beads, deep mirror-like black color, strung with a durable, stretchable rubber cord, suitable for wrist size 15–17cm.\n2. Composition & Structure\n100% Natural Black Quartz, undyed, unheat-treated. High polish, strong light reflection, Mohs hardness 7.0.\n3. Manufacturing Process\nSelected rough stone from Brazil mines, slice cut – round polished – polishing – energy inspection – hand-strung at Ann Gem & Fengshui workshop (Vietnam).\n4. Key Functions\n\n• Personal protection (Hộ Thân), house protection (Trấn Trạch), wards off evil.\n\n• Increases focus, alertness, steadfastness, beneficial for smooth work progression.\n\n• Balances Yin – Yang energy.\n\n5. Unique Selling Points (USP)\n\n• Rare deep mirror polish, no artificial treatment.\n\n• Energy inspected using a magnetic field meter in Vietnam.\n\n• Specialized Ann Gem & Fengshui packaging, includes guide booklet for care & Feng Shui usage.\n\n6. Recommended Users\n\n• People working under pressure, in finance, healthcare, psychology, law.\n\n• People who frequently travel, work in crowded places.\n\n• Meditators, yoga practitioners, spiritual seekers.\n\n7. Precautions\nShould not be worn when swimming in the sea, soaking in salt water, or exposed to strong chemical cleaning agents to avoid affecting the string cord.\n8. Why choose this product\nThis is the most basic yet effective energy-balancing Feng Shui bracelet, suitable for all ages, serving as both a protective talisman and a modern aesthetic symbol.\n\n\n________________________________________\n💬 FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ)\nQ: How is Black Quartz different from Obsidian (volcanic glass)?\nA: Obsidian is volcanic glass, with hot and strong energy; while Black Quartz (Morion) is a true quartz crystal, with deeper and more sustainable energy.\nQ: Can it be worn with other bracelets?\nA: Yes, especially when combined with white quartz or red agate, it will create a protective energy field and activate fortune (Vận Khí).\nQ: When should the bracelet's energy be cleansed?\nA: Every 30–45 days. Use moonlight, incense smoke, or place it on white quartz.\n\n\n________________________________________\n🧭 AUTHENTICITY CHECK GUIDE\n\n• Polish: Real black quartz has a mirror-like polish, not a “plastic dullness” or excessively light weight.\n\n• Touch Sensation: Real stone is cool to the touch even in a warm environment.\n\n• Hardness: Does not scratch when gently rubbed with metal.\n\n• Air Bubbles: No bubbles or hollow crevices in the beads."
