    "fullDescriptionEn": "GEMSTONE PORTRAIT OF A NATIONAL LEADER (ETHICS & WISDOM)\n(Size 80 × 110 cm – natural gemstone material)\nIn East Asian culture, the image of a spiritual leader – simple, wise, and humane – is always seen as a “guiding light” for a nation. It is not the power of weapons or authority, but the power of ethics – wisdom – and compassion for the people.\n\n1. Energy of “Virtue – Ethics – Wisdom – Heart” (Đạo – Đức – Trí – Tâm)\nIn Feng Shui, the portrait carries four energy layers:\n\n• Virtue (Đạo) → leading toward goodness, guidance\n\n• Ethics (Đức) → maintaining harmony, sustainability\n\n• Wisdom (Trí) → clarity, insight\n\n• Heart (Tâm) → benevolence, peace\nWhen expressed through natural gemstones, this energy is “anchored” – radiating throughout the living space as an auspicious energy field.\n\n2. Power of House Protection (Trấn Trạch) – Spiritual Enlightenment\nA leader’s portrait is often placed in:\n\n• the living room\n\n• the office\n\n• the traditional room\n\n• corporate offices\n\nNot just for decoration, but to:\n\n• stabilize the emotions of family members\n\n• maintain order – harmony in the space\n\n• dispel bad energy, create a magnetic field of peace\n\n• remind of responsibility – ethics – vision\n\nAncient people said: “Where righteous chi resides, fortune flourishes – the mind is at peace – the door is bright.” And the strongest righteous chi comes from the image of someone living for the community.\n\n3. Energy of Simplicity – Purity\nThe white attire symbolizes:\n\n• purity\n\n• clarity/wisdom\n\n• sincerity\n\nThe green garden space behind brings:\n\n• Wood chi nurturing life force (Sinh Lực)\n\n• Gentle Fire chi from the flower colors → creates harmonious warmth\n\n• Earth chi from the bamboo chair → connects to tradition\n\n→ This is a rare harmonious Five Elements composition in the genre of gemstone portraits.\n\n4. An Artwork with “Intergenerational” Value\nA leader’s gemstone portrait carries not only Feng Shui value, but also:\n\n• cultural value\n\n• spiritual value\n\n• educational value\n\n• gratitude toward previous generations\n\n→ This is more than just a painting. This is a reminder: live kindly – live responsibly – live for others.\n\n\n________________________________________\nPRODUCT INFORMATION\n\n• Product Name: Gemstone Portrait of a National Leader – Essence of Ethics & Wisdom\n\n• English Name: Gemstone Portrait of a National Leader – Wisdom & Integrity\n\n• Origin: Natural gemstones from Vietnam – Brazil – Madagascar\n\n• Processing & Finishing: Ann Gem & Fengshui cooperative workshop (100% handcrafted)\n\n• Distribution Brand: Ann Gem & Fengshui – Recharge Your Energy, Restore Your Balance.\n\n• Size: 80 × 110 cm\n\n• Material: Quartz – agate – black stone – aventurine – natural dyed stones creating a 3D bright effect\n\n\n________________________________________\n💰 PRICING\n\n| Category | Price (VND) | Note |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Retail List Price | 11,129,000 VND code AGFS 061 (general certification) | Includes 10% VAT, excludes shipping |\n| Market Price | 10,350,000 VND code AGFS 061 (general certification) | Includes VAT, excludes shipping |\n\n\n________________________________________\n🌈 FENG SHUI MEANING – INTERPRETATION OF THE ARTWORK\n1. Feng Shui Characteristics\n\n| Characteristic | Feng Shui Analysis |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Simple – Calm Leader Figure | Creates humble, wise energy field, mental stability |\n| Focused Working Gesture | Carries energy of diligence – discipline – concentration |\n| Garden Space & Ancient Tree | Strong Wood chi (Mộc Khí) → nurtures vital energy – increases longevity |\n| Bright – Pure Color Scheme | Increases Yang chi (Dương Khí), purifies the space |\n\n2. Feng Shui Uses\n\n• Grounds the spirit (Trấn Tĩnh) – creates a feeling of peace and harmony\n\n• Increases wisdom – clarity – decisiveness in decisions\n\n• Attracts benefactors, human harmony, respect\n\n• Cultivates morality – benevolence – integrity, very suitable for families prioritizing tradition\n\n• Helps the space become warm – stable – pure\n\n\n3. Symbolic Meaning\nThe artwork symbolizes:\n\n• The spirit for the people – for the nation\n\n• Humility, simplicity, but profound wisdom\n\n• Benevolence & a moral example\n\n• Guidance through culture – education – spirit\n\n→ This is an artwork with timeless spiritual value, not just to admire but to “remind – reflect – inspire.”\n\n\n________________________________________\n💎 EXPERT FENG SHUI INTERPRETATION\n1. Energy Science\nGemstones supplement energy:\n\n• White Quartz: purification – wisdom\n\n• Agate: endurance – emotional stability\n\n• Black Stone: house protection – safeguard\n\n• Aventurine: luck – smooth progression\n\n→ The artwork creates an “ethics + wisdom + peace chi field.”\n\n\n2. Feng Shui House Protection (Trấn Trạch)\nThe leader’s portrait gemstone painting carries energy of:\n\n• Strong righteous chi (Chính Khí)\n\n• Neutralizes conflicts, resolves disputes\n\n• Increases harmony in the family / business\n\n• Protects the space from evil chi (Tà Khí)\n\n• Compatible with Wood – Water – Fire – Earth – Metal elements.\n\n\n3. Application in Living Space\nShould be placed in:\n\n• Living room\n\n• Office\n\n• Corporate lobby\n\n• Traditional room – ancestral hall\n\n• Cultural – educational spaces\n\n\n________________________________________\n🪶 FENG SHUI PRODUCT PROFILE\n1. Product Description\nThe gemstone portrait artwork of a cultural – spiritual leader of the nation, working in a serene natural setting. Clear colors – harmonious composition – strong energy field.\n2. Composition\nQuartz, agate, serpentine, black stone, polished mineral base.\n3. Key Functions\n\n• House protection (Trấn Trạch)\n\n• Inspiration\n\n• Increases righteous chi\n\n• Honors family / ancestral spiritual values\n\n4. USP/ Unique Selling Points\n\n• Gemstone portraits are very difficult to craft → high value\n\n• Significant spiritual – symbolic value\n\n• Permanent durability, colorfast\n\n• Strong Feng Shui properties due to natural stone\n\n• 5-year warranty\n\n5. Recommended Users\n\n• Families prioritizing tradition\n\n• Elderly people\n\n• Business owners\n\n• Cultural spaces – corporate offices\n\n• People wanting to boost wisdom and righteous chi\n\n\n________________________________________\n💬 FAQ – FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\n1. Is the painting color durable?\n\n→ Yes. Natural gemstones retain their color permanently.\n2. Where is the best place to hang it?\n\n→ Living room, office, corporate lobby.\n\n\n________________________________________\n🧭 AUTHENTICITY CHECK GUIDE\n\n• Real stone → cool to the touch, heavy, natural light reflection\n\n• Surface has a slight texture → due to 3D stone mosaic\n\n• Not smooth or flat like industrial stone powder paintings\n\n• Natural bright color, no smudging\n\n🌿 “Looking at the painting brings peace.”\nGemstone portrait of the national leader: house protection – enlightenment – nurtures wisdom and ethics. An artwork for those who cherish the values of life and human morality. 👉 Order now – bring righteous chi home."
